            "detailed_description": "&quot;On the front line&quot; - tank simulator. Action takes place during World War II. <br>Battles are unilaterally - for the Red Army. <br>Action in the game takes place on two large locations. <br>Sequential execution of combat missions. <br><br>The player carries out management of the tank with the arrow keys -W,S,A,D and mouse . <br>Mouse wheel - controls the distance between the camera and a tank player.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >the Player Has Two Tanks Support (ai). </h2></h2>In the case of the death of player , game does not end. <br>Control passes to one of the supporters of the tanks. <br>The game has a medium tanks, they are more motile, less protected and have a less powerful projectiles. <br>There are also heavy tanks have more powerful projectiles, but less speed and less maneuverability.<br><br>ATTENTION !!! Before the game, you need to become familiar with the input keys.<br>Menu&gt;&gt;Settings&gt;&gt;Control.",
